		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Gaunt locust-man with four gangly, thin arms and fly wings. Revel in slow torture, feeds on fear of insects.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 20, <strong>ATK</strong> 4 claw +2 (1d6) or buzzing madness, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 4</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Buzzing Madness</strong>. Mortals within near that hear the sahkil's buzzing, CHA 12+ or dazed for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Great Evil</strong>. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
